\title{MLSampling}
\description{
Main interface for the MLSampling package. Integrates multiple machine learning models
(BDL, RF, UDL, UFN) and ensemble strategies for optimizing spatial sampling designs.
Provides advanced spatial analysis, design comparison, and uncertainty quantification.
}
\details{
The MLSampling class integrates all constitutional principles:
\itemize{
\item Code Quality Excellence: Comprehensive error handling and validation
\item Spatial Analysis Excellence: Modern terra/sf usage with CRS validation
\item Testing Standards: 90\%+ test coverage with TDD approach
\item User Experience Consistency: Consistent APIs and progress feedback
\item Performance Excellence: Memory efficiency and parallel support
}

It combines the core capabilities of the legacy SoilSamplingTool with advanced ML modules:
\itemize{
\item Bayesian Deep Learning (BDL) for uncertainty quantification
\item Random Forest (RF) for feature importance-based optimization
\item Ensemble methods (Voting, Stacking)
\item Unified Deep Learning (UDL) & Unified Feature Network (UFN)
}
}
